<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Philemon</book>
  <para style="h">Philemon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Philemon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philemon</para>
  <para style="mt">Philemon</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khris Jesu hang tawh thongkie Paul le ka sanggam pa uh Timothy in, ka lawm it ule ka naseppi uh Philemon le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka sanggam nu uh Apphia, ka galkappi uh Archippus le nangma’ inna a kikhawm pawlpi tungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Pasien le Topa Jesu Khris tung panin hepina le lungmuonna note tungah hing tung taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thungetna ah note kang phaw sielin ka Pasien tungah nuomthu ka tut zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile misiengthote zosie na it dan ule Topa Jesu na upnate uh ka na za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kote in Khris adingin na hoi zosie ka sep thei lam uh na thei ciengin, na upna na hopsawnna ah a muibut thei nadingin thu kang nget pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka sanggam pa aw, nang tungtawnin misiengthote’ lungsim thasuosah zo na hi ziehin, keima in na itna tung panin lungdamna lienpi le hanthotna ka na nga tahtah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tami thu ziehin na tavuon na sep nadingin Khris sungah hang tahin thu hing pie ngam nanleng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />itna bulphu-in kang thumzaw hi. A khangham keima Paul in tulai tahin Jesu Khris adingin thongkie ka hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ka thongkieh sunga ama’ pa a suoh keima in ka tapa Onesimus adingin kang thumpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nidangin nang adingin ama a kizang thei sih a, ahi vangin tu-in nang le kei adingin a kizang thei tahtah ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima’ pumpi za ma-in ngaisunin na kungah ama kang sawlkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lungdamna thu zieha ka thongkieh sungin nangma tanga ei kem dingin ka kungah ama ka omsah nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanle na gamtatna hoite paubawl hi loin nangma’ thu tawh a sem na hi thei nadingin, na thukimpina om lopi-in bangma ka bawl nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khan tawntungin ama na neikia thei nadinga bakhat sung kikhen pah zong na hi kha thei ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tu-in ama pen sila bang hi nawn loin sila sanga thupizaw sanggam it khat ang hita hi, adieh diehin kei adingin ama a manphat ma bangin cilesa sung le Topa sungah sanggam khat ahina tawh nang adingin manphazaw kan lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n na naseppi banga nei ngaisut leh, kei nei san bangin ama zong na sangkia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in lam khatpopo-ah nangma tunga suhkhiel a nei a, leibat khatpo a nei khah leh keima’ batin na ciemte in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima Paul in kang sangkia ding hi, ci thu ka khut mama tawh kang giel ahi hi: Nangma’ pumpi mama nangawn zong kei tunga nei bat hi, ci thu bangma a gen ka hi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi hi, sanggam aw, nangma tung panin Topa sungah tami hamphatna ei ngasah in! Khris sungah ka lungsim hing thasuosah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ei mang dingin kang muong a, kang nget sanga a hoizaw nangawn hing bawl na vateh ci thu thei kawmin lai kang giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua banah kei adingin ka zin tunna ding innkhan khat a baisa-in na bawl un, azieh pen na thungetna uh tungtawnin na kung vua ang tung theikia dingin ka kilamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu Khris sungah thong ka kiehpi Epaphras a kipanin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ka naseppite ahi Mark, Aristarchus, Demas le Luke in zong ang noset hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa Jesu Khris’ hepina, na hlagau utawh hing om taheh.
  </para>
</usx>
